2. Permitted use. Permission is granted, free of charge, to any person or institution to
   use, copy, modify and redistribute the Work, in source or derived form, for
   non-commercial academic purposes: research, teaching, study and scholarly publication.

3. Conditions.
   a. Attribution. Copies and derived works must retain this notice and credit
      "Culegeri, Thomas Saar, University of Melbourne", with a link to the source
      repository or to https://culegeri.vercel.app.
   b. Source integrity. Derived works that present records from the Work must keep each
      record's link to its original catalogue entry or printed page.
   c. Same terms. Redistributed or derived versions of the Work must be made available
      under this licence.

4. Prohibited use. Commercial use of any kind is not permitted, including sale, paid
   access, advertising-supported distribution and use within a commercial product or
