   requires the written permission of the copyright holder.

5. No warranty. The Work is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Data in the
   Work were produced by automated crawling, optical character recognition and
   place-name resolution and may contain errors; users are responsible for checking
   records against their sources.

6. Requests. Permission for uses outside this licence may be sought from
   tsaar@student.unimelb.edu.au.
